			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "sub[0]=999 also changes s[1]=999!\nSame physical memory, two views.\n\nFix: copy(dst, src)\nor: b:=s[1:3:3]  (3-index slice)\n  forces cap=len -> append copies",
			"fontSize": 13,
