			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1772386351225,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "MENTAL MODEL: SliceHeader = TV remote (24B on stack).  Backing array = the TV (on heap).\n   Multiple remotes can point to the same TV. append() buys a NEW TV when len==cap (growslice+memcopy).\nPRE-ALLOCATE: make([]T, 0, n) -> zero reallocations  |  nil slice safe for append/len/range/cap",
			"fontSize": 13,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "MENTAL MODEL: SliceHeader = TV remote (24B on stack).  Backing array = the TV (on heap).\n   Multiple remotes can point to the same TV. append() buys a NEW TV when len==cap (growslice+memcopy).\nPRE-ALLOCATE: make([]T, 0, n) -> zero reallocations  |  nil slice safe for append/len/range/cap",
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
